WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.589
When reading a CTE query do not read top to bottom
as one giant statement

00:00:06.447 --> 00:00:12.079
First understand the CTE by itself Then ask what the
final

00:00:12.106 --> 00:00:17.730
query does with that stage Here the CTE filters
patients

00:00:19.471 --> 00:00:25.335
The final query joins admissions and aggregates This
staged reading style

00:00:25.348 --> 00:00:27.796
is one reason CTEs improve clarity
